==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Haniwanwan]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since you're running [[Can Can Cat]] anyways, just spam it and you win. It's possible to beat this stage before the Loris spawns, but doing so requires a heavy boost on your Can Can or other rushers like [[Fishman Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Cradle Wilderness is the only [[Continuation Stage]] in a Colossus [[Gauntlet]] to not have a difficulty in its title, where it should be "Deadly".

